    <string name="htp_title">How to Play</string>
    <string name="htp_skate">SKATE</string>
    <string name="htp_skate_body">Touch anywhere on the left half of the screen and drag. Your skater follows the stick in that direction. Let go to glide.</string>
    <string name="htp_shoot">SHOOT</string>
    <string name="htp_shoot_body">Hold to wind up, release to fire. Push the stick up or down while you shoot to aim for a corner.
Without the puck: poke-check the puck carrier.</string>
    <string name="htp_pass">PASS</string>
    <string name="htp_pass_body">Tap to pass to the teammate you are pointing at. Control switches to the receiver.
Without the puck: switch to the skater closest to the puck.</string>
    <string name="htp_hit">HIT</string>
    <string name="htp_hit_body">Tap to lunge into a body check. Knock the carrier down and the puck comes loose.</string>
    <string name="htp_rules">GAME FLOW</string>
    <string name="htp_rules_body">Three periods on the clock, faceoffs after every whistle, goalies freeze pucks. Tied after three? Sudden-death overtime.</string>
    <string name="htp_tip">The yellow ring marks the skater you control.</string>
    <string name="htp_done">Got it</string>
    <string name="controls_help">Left side: drag anywhere to skate.\n\nSHOOT: hold to wind up, release to fire. Push the stick up or down while shooting to pick a corner. Without the puck it pokes at the carrier.\n\nPASS: sends the puck to the teammate in the direction you are pushing. Without the puck it switches to the skater nearest the puck.\n\nHIT: lunge into a body check and knock the carrier off the puck.\n\nThree periods, sudden-death overtime if tied.</string>
